desc:
[UNOFFICIAL]

Create and build your own maps that can be played just like in Forsaken!

This game frequently updates for minor changes. Join the server via social links to get notified when the game updates!

WARNING: This game is in its early alpha stages so expect LOTS of bugs and issues with saving slots.

DISCLAIMER: This game is made for MEDIUM - SMALL maps. (PER SLOT LIMIT 1.85MB)

If you own something which is in the game and want it removed, please message me.

